---
description: Keep gates local. Do not add GitHub Actions workflows.
alwaysApply: true
---

CI on this repo is scarce. Keep `.github/workflows/e2e.yml`. Do not add another workflow for lint, unit tests, or model checks.

Encode a repeating mistake as architecture, then types, then an ESLint rule whose error names the fix, then a `lib/*.test.ts` file. Those tests run from `.githooks/pre-commit` and `pnpm test`. `pnpm lint` and `pnpm build` are the other local gates.

TLA+ and other formal checks stay behind a local `pnpm` script. Never give them a GitHub Actions job.
